  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet inneb&#xe4;r en revision av konsultbolaget IFL Emerging Markets&apos; instatser i Ryssland. Detta g&#xf6;rs f&#xf6;r att verifiera att hanteringen av bist&#xe5;ndsmedel, internkontroll, redovisning samt fakturering av utf&#xf6;rda tj&#xe4;nster hos IFL Emerging Markets sker i enlighet med ing&#xe5;ngna &#xf6;verenskommelser och god redovisningssed.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project regards an audit of the consultant company IFL Emerging Markets&apos; services in Russia. This is done to verify that the management of funds, internal control, accounting and invoicing of services carried out by them has been done according to agreements and accounting custom.</narrative>
  </description>
